    "Rise time, fall time, undershoot and impulse width require those values from TimingAnalyzer or retained impulse descriptors.",
    "Compression ratio from steady sine RMS is descriptive, not a replacement for a dedicated envelope/dynamics test."
  ],
  "optimisationsAdded": [
    "Residual peak, crest, zero-crossing rate, kurtosis, sparsity, centroid, spread, flatness, tonality and dominant frequency",
